# 📊 Student Placement Datasets

This repository contains six synthetic datasets related to student CGPA, IQ, package, and placement status. These datasets can be used for data analysis, data visualization, and machine learning practice.

## 📁 Available Datasets

| No. | Dataset Filename | Rows | Columns |
|---:|---|---:|---|
| 1 | `cgpa_package_100.csv` | 100 | CGPA, Package |
| 2 | `cgpa_package_300.csv` | 300 | CGPA, Package |
| 3 | `cgpa_iq_package_100.csv` | 100 | CGPA, IQ, Package |
| 4 | `cgpa_iq_package_300.csv` | 300 | CGPA, IQ, Package |
| 5 | `placement_yes_no_100.csv` | 100 | CGPA, IQ, Placement |
| 6 | `placement_yes_no_300.csv` | 300 | CGPA, IQ, Placement |

## 🚀 How to Use These Datasets

You can load these CSV files directly from GitHub into **Google Colab, Kaggle Notebooks, Jupyter Notebook, or any Python environment with internet access**.

Install pandas if necessary:

```python
pip install pandas
```

### 1. Load `cgpa_package_100.csv`

```python
import pandas as pd

url = "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CodeWithAli51/CodeWithAli51/main/cgpa_package_100.csv"

df = pd.read_csv(url)

print(df.head())
```

